<content><![CDATA[<media-image source="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/haxtheweb/art/main/web/haxtheweb/hax-of-the-web/poster-1600w.webp" alt="Arcade title screen: a pixel-art zombie pirate girl in front of a haunted house under a full moon, beside dripping horror letters reading HAX of the Web, with PRESS START below."></media-image>
<p>A Halloween arcade title screen starring the rpg-character's zombie pirate girl (the element's zpg seed). Type cheat codes, ask Merlin, or press start to drop into a real HAXcms site and edit it.</p>
<p><em>A homage to the title screen of a 1990s light-gun zombie arcade game. Its art, audio and text are all original.</em></p>
